WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:20.267
"Settle down, students!" Mr. Freaky said.

2
00:00:20.268 --> 00:00:24.975
"The assembly is about to start! Please sit down!"

3
00:00:24.976 --> 00:00:31.094
Ben quickly found Winnie and some other friends inside the crowded auditorium.

4
00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:35.593
As he sat down, he saw some buckets onstage.

5
00:00:35.594 --> 00:00:42.861
Mr. Freaky walked over to speak to Mr. Bog, the school custodian, who was mopping up puddles.

6
00:00:42.862 --> 00:00:45.493
"What happened here?" Ben asked.

7
00:00:45.494 --> 00:00:48.061
Winnie sighed.

8
00:00:48.062 --> 00:00:52.202
"It rained last night. So the roof is leaking again."

9
00:00:52.203 --> 00:00:56.909
"Are they ever going to fix it?" Ben asked.

10
00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:03.473
"Maybe after they fix the heat and paint some of the classrooms," Winnie replied, making a face.

11
00:01:03.474 --> 00:01:09.002
Mr. Freaky tripped on a bucket as he walked back toward the microphone.

12
00:01:09.003 --> 00:01:11.483
"Don't worry about the leaky roof, students.

13
00:01:11.484 --> 00:01:16.018
Our Career Day assembly will start in exactly three minutes."

14
00:01:16.019 --> 00:01:19.709
"I love Career Day!" Mog exclaimed.

15
00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:23.214
Ben laughed.

16
00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:28.544
He knew why Mog liked graveyard hockey and slug cakes.

17
00:01:28.545 --> 00:01:33.176
But he wasn't sure why Mog was so enthusiastic about Career Day.

18
00:01:33.177 --> 00:01:37.093
"What do you want to be when you grow up, Mog?" Gaby asked.

19
00:01:37.094 --> 00:01:39.280
"I don't know," Mog said.

20
00:01:39.281 --> 00:01:41.753
"That's why I like hearing about jobs.

21
00:01:41.754 --> 00:01:50.207
I could be anything—a firefighter, a Creepy Train engineer . . ."

22
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:55.333
"Well, I intend to be the best wizard in the world!" Waldo said.

23
00:01:55.334 --> 00:02:01.524
"Ah-choo!" He sneezed loudly, sending a cloud of black bats into the air.

24
00:02:01.525 --> 00:02:05.412
Mr. Freaky stomped across the stage and frowned at Waldo.

25
00:02:05.413 --> 00:02:10.035
"You know the rules, Waldo. No spells during an assembly!"

26
00:02:10.036 --> 00:02:13.599
"Sorry. I have a cold. Ah-ah—"

27
00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:17.954
Waldo put his finger under his nose to stop another sneeze.

28
00:02:17.955 --> 00:02:22.783
"I'm not sure he has a cold," Winnie whispered to Ben.

29
00:02:22.784 --> 00:02:27.243
"He messed up in spell casting class yesterday.

30
00:02:27.244 --> 00:02:30.151
I think he put a spell on himself."

31
00:02:30.152 --> 00:02:32.934
Mr. Freaky tapped the microphone.

32
00:02:32.935 --> 00:02:37.080
"Welcome to Monster Academy's annual Career Day assembly.

33
00:02:37.081 --> 00:02:41.630
Our first guest today is . . . Cleo's uncle Tut."

34
00:02:41.631 --> 00:02:46.913
Cheers filled the auditorium. "Woo-hoo!"

35
00:02:46.914 --> 00:02:50.464
The mummy strode proudly onto the stage.

36
00:02:50.465 --> 00:02:55.847
"Good morning. I used to be the king of Egypt."

37
00:02:55.848 --> 00:02:59.848
"I doubt I'll ever be a king," Mog whispered.

38
00:02:59.849 --> 00:03:05.557
Ben grinned. "You could be the Monster Prom king."

39
00:03:05.558 --> 00:03:09.166
"That's not a job," Mog replied.

40
00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:14.012
A lizard monster was the speaker after Uncle Tut.

41
00:03:14.013 --> 00:03:19.515
"I wrestle alligators and sell them at the market," he said.

42
00:03:19.516 --> 00:03:24.570
Gaby smiled. "I could do that job. You could too, Mog."

43
00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:30.223
"Nah." Mog shook his head. "I don't like getting my fur wet."

44
00:03:30.224 --> 00:03:34.293
The next presenter was a vampire.

45
00:03:34.294 --> 00:03:36.224
"I'm a bat groomer.

46
00:03:36.225 --> 00:03:39.700
As you know, bats go out every night and . . ."

47
00:03:39.701 --> 00:03:42.029
She paused to roll her eyes.

48
00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:46.061
"When they return at dawn, their hair is a mess!"

49
00:03:46.062 --> 00:03:54.330
Everyone laughed, which made Waldo sneeze again.

50
00:03:54.331 --> 00:03:57.622
The room filled with blue smoke.

51
00:03:57.623 --> 00:04:03.537
Mr. Freaky groaned. "I said no spells, Waldo."

52
00:04:03.538 --> 00:04:06.827
He pulled out a handkerchief to mop his forehead.

53
00:04:06.828 --> 00:04:09.648
"Please be on your best behavior, students.

54
00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:12.815
Our next guest doesn't like magic."

55
00:04:12.816 --> 00:04:17.692
The students clapped as Mayor Hubbletree strode in.

56
00:04:17.693 --> 00:04:20.869
He puffed out his chest.

57
00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:25.278
"As you know, I have a very important job.

58
00:04:25.279 --> 00:04:27.860
I'm the mayor of People Place.

59
00:04:27.861 --> 00:04:32.109
This position has a lot of responsibilities."

60
00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:36.389
"Like making Mr. Freaky miserable," Gaby whispered.

61
00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:43.702
"As mayor, I'm in charge of every part of People Place," Mayor Hubbletree went on.

62
00:04:43.703 --> 00:04:46.014
"I manage the parks and buildings.

63
00:04:46.015 --> 00:04:50.185
I make laws and run the government."

64
00:04:50.186 --> 00:04:54.722
He frowned at all the buckets lined up onstage.

65
00:04:54.723 --> 00:04:59.566
"And I make sure our schools are in good shape.

66
00:04:59.567 --> 00:05:06.136
As you can see, being mayor is the most important job of all."

67
00:05:06.137 --> 00:05:09.780
"Thank you for coming, Mayor Hubbletree," Mr. Freaky said quickly.

68
00:05:09.781 --> 00:05:13.254
"I'm sure you have an important meeting to get to now."

69
00:05:13.255 --> 00:05:17.649
As the students applauded, the mayor spoke softly to Mr. Freaky.

70
00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:21.135
But Ben could hear his voice come through the microphone.

71
00:05:21.136 --> 00:05:24.552
"I'll talk to you later, Freaky," the mayor muttered.

72
00:05:24.553 --> 00:05:27.254
"It looks like we have a crisis here."

73
00:05:27.255 --> 00:05:29.653
"Crisis?" Ben thought.

74
00:05:29.654 --> 00:05:34.751
Before he could say anything to Winnie, the final guest scurried onto the stage.

75
00:05:34.752 --> 00:05:37.445
It was a dust collector carrying a broom.

76
00:05:37.446 --> 00:05:45.181
Waldo started sneezing again as clouds of dust drifted from the stage.

77
00:05:45.182 --> 00:05:48.420
The dust collector straightened his rags.

78
00:05:48.421 --> 00:05:51.995
"My job is very exciting," he said in a flat tone.

79
00:05:51.996 --> 00:05:56.527
"I collect dust. I begin sweeping at dawn and . . ."

80
00:05:56.528 --> 00:06:00.319
"Time for a nap," Mog whispered, shutting his eyes.

81
00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:04.071
"I'm not interested in dust collecting."

82
00:06:04.072 --> 00:06:11.070
Finally the dust monster was finished, and Mr. Freaky returned to the microphone.

83
00:06:11.071 --> 00:06:14.894
"I hope you enjoyed Career Day, students. We—"

84
00:06:14.895 --> 00:06:20.483
Just then the auditorium door banged open, and a skeleton clattered into the room.

85
00:06:20.484 --> 00:06:25.006
He had a long black beard and wore an eyepatch like a pirate.

86
00:06:25.007 --> 00:06:30.095
His other eye burned like fire as he waved a gleaming sword and snarled.

87
00:06:30.096 --> 00:06:34.509
"Give me all your gold!"
